00:05:51.684 --> 00:05:53.219
-What?

00:05:53.219 --> 00:05:54.820
-Yes, of course.

00:05:54.820 --> 00:05:56.355
You're getting close.

00:05:56.355 --> 00:05:58.291
-Are you tearing us apart?

00:05:58.291 --> 00:05:59.091
[ Laughter ]

00:05:59.091 --> 00:06:00.359
-You're close.

00:06:00.359 --> 00:06:02.127
-And it was about pizza.

00:06:02.127 --> 00:06:03.596
Do you not remember this?

00:06:03.596 --> 00:06:05.565
-No!
-We got into, like...

00:06:05.565 --> 00:06:07.133
