00:06:23.115 --> 00:06:24.383
-That is accurate.

00:06:24.383 --> 00:06:26.719
[ Laughter ]

00:06:26.719 --> 00:06:28.921
I thought more...

00:06:28.921 --> 00:06:30.623
-Oh, my God!

00:06:30.623 --> 00:06:33.960
Guys, I think that was the best
game of this we've ever played.

00:06:33.960 --> 00:06:36.161
You guys really know
your "Schitts Creek."

00:06:36.161 --> 00:06:37.563
-Thank you so much.
-Thanks.

00:06:37.563 --> 00:06:39.565
-Give it up for the cast
of "Schitts Creek"!

